{
  "_id": "fixed-deposit",
  "product_name": "Fixed Deposit",
  "product_type": "deposits",
  "descriptions": {
    "summary": "A lump sum deposited with a bank for a chosen term from 7 days to 10 years, at an interest rate locked in at booking, paid out periodically or with the principal at maturity.",
    "key_features": [
      "Rate locked in at booking for the whole term",
      "Terms from 7 days to 10 years",
      "Cumulative, quarterly or monthly interest payout",
      "Premature withdrawal at a disclosed reduced rate",
      "Deposit insurance by DICGC up to ₹5 lakh per depositor per bank"
    ],
    "long": "Mynt reference definition (India). Sources: RBI Master Direction on Interest Rate on Deposits (2016, as amended): term deposits from 7 days to 10 years; the rate is fixed for the term; on premature withdrawal interest is paid at the rate applicable to the period the deposit actually ran, less a penalty disclosed upfront; since October 2023 all individuals' term deposits of ₹1 crore and below must allow premature withdrawal; single deposits of ₹3 crore and above are bulk deposits for scheduled commercial banks, so this retail product stops below that; interest on matured deposits left unclaimed is the lower of the savings rate and the contracted rate. Deposit insurance by DICGC up to ₹5 lakh per depositor per bank, across all accounts in the same capacity. Tax is deducted at source on interest above the statutory threshold unless the depositor files the declaration the Income-tax rules allow. ASSUMPTIONS (indicative; each bank sets its own): the 6.5% card rate, the 50 bps senior-citizen bonus, the 1% premature-withdrawal penalty, the ₹1,000 minimum, no interest when closed within 7 days, and the PAN check on large deposits (thresholds as in the Income-tax rules in 2025). A Mynt reference product names no providers, partners or risk models: the bank that offers it adds its own licence, KYC and funding handoffs (with their consent purposes), and governs its own models in its GRC folder.",
    "documents": {
      "deposit_insurance": "https://www.dicgc.org.in/",
      "complaints_ombudsman": "https://cms.rbi.org.in/"
    }
  },
  "owner_entity_id": null,
